### Enterprise AI Gateway — Demo test requests
### Use the VS Code REST Client extension to run these.

@gateway    = https://<your-apim>.azure-api.net
@token      = <paste Entra ID access token here>

### Scenario 4: Foundry (Azure OpenAI) — OpenAI-shaped request
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/openai/deployments/gpt-4o/chat/completions?api-version=2024-02-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "You are a concise assistant."},
    {"role": "user",   "content": "Summarize the value of an AI Gateway in 2 lines."}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 150
}

### Scenario 4: Anthropic — same OpenAI-shaped request
POST {{gateway}}/anthropic/v1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Summarize the value of an AI Gateway in 2 lines."}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 150
}

### Scenario 4: Bedrock — same shape, different path
POST {{gateway}}/bedrock/model/anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022-v2:0/invoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Summarize the value of an AI Gateway in 2 lines."}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 150
}

### Scenario 4: Vertex — same shape
POST {{gateway}}/vertex/v1/projects/aigw-demo/locations/us-central1/publishers/google/models/gemini-1.5-pro:generateContent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Summarize the value of an AI Gateway in 2 lines."}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 150
}

### Scenario 2: Trigger token-limit 429 (blast Marketing tier)
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/openai/deployments/gpt-4o/chat/completions?api-version=2024-02-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [{"role":"user","content":"Write a 2000-word essay on cloud governance."}],
  "max_tokens": 4000
}

### Scenario 1: After removing user from AIGW-Team-Marketing → expect 401
POST {{gateway}}/foundry/openai/deployments/gpt-4o/chat/completions?api-version=2024-02-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"ping"}], "max_tokens": 10}
